---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
description: The Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027 brings tea exporters, buyers, investors and technology providers together in Nairobi from 21–23 April 2027. Register your interest.
basePath: /
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  permalink: "{% if locale == 'en' %}/index.html{% else %}/zh/index.html{% endif %}"
  lang: "{% if locale == 'zh' %}zh-Hans{% else %}en{% endif %}"
  translationStatus: "{% if locale == 'en' %}source{% else %}machine{% endif %}"
---
{% from "components/image-grid.njk" import grid %}

<section class="hero">
  {% include "components/hero-media.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__grid">
      <div>
        <h1>The premier tea trade, investment and innovation forum connecting Africa and China</h1>
        <p class="hero__theme">{{ summit.theme }}</p>

        <dl class="particulars">
          <div class="field">
            <dt class="label">Location</dt>
            <dd class="value">{{ summit.location.city }}, {{ summit.location.country }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <dt class="label">Dates</dt>
            <dd class="value"><time datetime="{{ summit.dates.start }}/{{ summit.dates.end }}">{{ summit.dates.display }}</time></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <dt class="label">Days to opening</dt>
            <dd class="value"><span data-countdown="{{ summit.dates.start }}">{{ summit.dates.start | daysUntil }}</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <dt class="label">Venue</dt>
            <dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <dt class="label">Organised by</dt>
            <dd class="value">{{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <p class="hero__body">Three days that put Kenyan growers, processors and exporters in the same rooms as Chinese buyers, investors and technology providers. Trade on day one, capital and innovation on day two, the expo floor on day three.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="issue">
        <div class="issue__head">
          <h2>Register your interest</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="issue__note">Six categories, from delegate to exhibitor. Registration is open as an expression of interest — fees, deadlines and inclusions are set by the secretariat and published here once confirmed.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--block" href="/registration/">Register interest</a>
        <hr class="rule">
        <p class="issue__note">Exhibiting or partnering instead?</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--block" href="/sponsorship/">Partnership enquiry</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="figure-pair">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>What is being convened</h2>
        </div>
        <p>A landmark international platform designed to deepen trade, investment, innovation and cultural cooperation between Kenya and China within the tea value chain.</p>
        <p>Kenya grows the tea. China drinks more of it than anywhere on earth. Between those two facts sits a chain of buyers, processors, financiers, freight operators and regulators who rarely occupy the same building. For three days in April 2027, they will.</p>
        <p><a href="/about/">More about the summit</a></p>
      </div>
      {{ grid([
        {src:"/img/plates/rows-morning", alt:"Contour rows of a highland tea plantation in early morning mist.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/leaf-close",   alt:"Close view of fresh two-leaves-and-a-bud tea shoots.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/highland",     alt:"Kenyan highland landscape with a red earth track through tea fields.", w:1200, h:900}
      ], "Kenya's growing highlands", "I") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Six objectives</h2>
      <p>The terms this summit is convened under.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="clauses">
      {% for o in summit.objectives %}
      <li class="clause">
        <div>
          <h3>{{ o.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ o.body }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <table class="manifest">
      <caption class="section-head">
        <h2>Three days</h2>
        <p>Session times, rooms and speakers are added to this manifest as they are confirmed.</p>
      </caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Day</th>
          <th scope="col">Proceedings</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for d in summit.programme %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ d.day }} &middot; <time datetime="{{ d.date }}">{{ d.date | readableDate }}</time></td>
          <td>
            <h3>{{ d.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ d.summary }}</p>
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><a href="/programme/">Full programme</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ink">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="figure-pair figure-pair--flip">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>The expo floor</h2>
        </div>
        <p>The International Tea &amp; Technology Expo runs alongside the summit: tea products, processing equipment, agricultural technologies and logistics services, shown to the people who buy them.</p>
        <p>Stand allocation opens with registration. Structured B2B matchmaking runs through day two, so an exhibitor's meetings are booked before they land.</p>
        <p><a href="/exhibition/">Exhibition and stands</a></p>
      </div>
      {{ grid([
        {src:"/img/plates/withering", alt:"Withering troughs of green leaf in a tea factory.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/sorting",   alt:"Graded black tea separated into piles on a sorting surface.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/sacks",     alt:"Stacked unmarked hessian sacks of bulk tea in a warehouse.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/chest-stack", alt:"Stack of plain plywood shipping chests with metal corner protectors.", w:1200, h:900}
      ], "Processing and the expo floor", "II") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Six ways to attend</h2>
      <p>Each category is registered separately. Fees and inclusions are published once the secretariat confirms them.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="classes">
      {% for c in summit.registrationCategories %}
      <li class="class-row">
        <span class="class-row__code">Class {{ loop.index }}</span>
        <span class="class-row__name">{{ c.name }}</span>
        <p>{{ c.blurb }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Partnership</h2>
      <p>Five tiers, each an endorsement on the summit's record. Benefits and rates are issued by the secretariat on enquiry.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="endorsements">
      {% for t in summit.sponsorshipTiers %}
      <li class="endorsement">
        <span class="endorsement__tier">{{ t.name }}</span>
        <span class="endorsement__line">Unallocated</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="section-action"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/sponsorship/">Partnership enquiry</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ink">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="figure-pair">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Coming to Nairobi</h2>
        </div>
        <p>The secretariat coordinates flights, hotel reservations, tea plantation tours and safari extensions for delegations. Details are published as arrangements are confirmed.</p>
        <p><a href="/travel/">Travel and stay</a></p>
      </div>
      {{ grid([
        {src:"/img/plates/liquor",      alt:"Porcelain cupping bowls holding brewed tea liquor of varying strengths.", w:1200, h:900},
        {src:"/img/plates/acacia-dusk", alt:"Flat-topped acacia against a dusk sky over open savannah.", w:1200, h:900}
      ], "Coming to Nairobi", "III") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
